From 683ff9d2a4e922bbeb279e507a91460028339888 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tyler South <tsouth2@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 09:46:39 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Move try-omarchy-export onto the Try Omarchy importer

try-omarchy-export now hands off to the importer that the release helper
builds from the launcher repository into
/usr/local/lib/try-omarchy/try-omarchy-import.pyz. The archive carries
only what the user changed, with the skeleton copies as merge bases, and
the importer itself, so a clean install runs the same code with import.sh.
Compatibility revision 44 delivers the wrapper and the importer to existing
guests.
---
